flowchart TD
    Start([CPU Scheduling Module Entry]) --> InputProc[/Receive Process List: PID, AT, BT, Priority/]
    InputProc --> ValProc{Validate: BT > 0, AT >= 0, Unique PIDs}
    ValProc -- Error --> ShowErr[Raise / Show ValueError] --> InputProc
    ValProc -- Valid --> SelectAlgo{Select Algorithm}

    SelectAlgo -- 1. FCFS --> SortAT[Sort ready processes by Arrival Time]
    SortAT --> LoopFCFS[Execute process until completion non-preemptively]

    SelectAlgo -- 2. SJF --> CheckReadySJF[Filter processes with AT <= current_time]
    CheckReadySJF --> PickShortest[Select process with min BT; ties by AT, PID]
    PickShortest --> ExecSJF[Execute non-preemptively to completion]

    SelectAlgo -- 3. Round Robin --> ConfigQ[/Input Time Quantum q >= 1/]
    ConfigQ --> EnqueueInit[Enqueue initial ready processes]
    EnqueueInit --> LoopRR[Execute head process for min remaining_time, q]
    LoopRR --> CheckArrivals[Check & enqueue new arrivals at current_time]
    CheckArrivals --> RequeuePreempted[Re-enqueue preempted process if remaining_time > 0]

    SelectAlgo -- 4. Priority --> CheckReadyPrio[Filter processes with AT <= current_time]
    CheckReadyPrio --> PickPrio[Select lowest numeric priority value; ties by AT, PID]
    PickPrio --> ExecPrio[Execute non-preemptively to completion]

    LoopFCFS --> CheckAllDone{All processes completed?}
    ExecSJF --> CheckAllDone
    RequeuePreempted --> CheckAllDone
    ExecPrio --> CheckAllDone

    CheckAllDone -- No & Queue Empty --> AdvanceIdle[Advance time to next AT: Log IDLE Slot] --> SelectAlgo
    CheckAllDone -- No & Ready --> SelectAlgo
    CheckAllDone -- Yes --> CalcMetrics[Calculate CT, TAT = CT - AT, WT = TAT - BT, RT]
    CalcMetrics --> CalcAvg[Calculate Average WT and Average TAT]
    CalcAvg --> BuildGantt[Assemble Timeline Segments into Gantt Chart]
    BuildGantt --> DisplayCPU[/Output Results Table & Gantt Chart/] --> EndNode([Return])
